      "updated": 1793991078289,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> In User defined bridge networking there is automatic DNS resolution so\neven without IP we can ping only by name.\n-> Whereas we require IP in default bridge networking.",
      "rawText": "-> In User defined bridge networking there is automatic DNS resolution so even without IP we can ping only by name.\n-> Whereas we require IP in default bridge networking.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> In User defined bridge networking there is automatic DNS resolution so even without IP we can ping only by name.\n-> Whereas we require IP in default bridge networking.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false
    },
